.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-release-sums 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-release\-sums \- Hash a published release\*(Aqs own assets into a checksum manifest, never the manifest itself
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten release sums\fR [\fB\-\-out\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-names\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-manifest\fR> [\fItag\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Hash a published release\*(Aqs own assets into a checksum manifest, never the manifest itself
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-manifest\fR \fI<manifest>\fR
The checksum manifest\*(Aqs file name, as the release carries it
.TP
\fB\-\-out\-dir\fR \fI<out_dir>\fR
Write the manifest under this directory (default: checksums)
.TP
\fB\-\-names\fR
Print the manifest\*(Aqs path as sums=<path> and exit, with no tag, network or download
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fItag\fR]
The release\*(Aqs tag; empty or absent is the latest release
